{
  "about": "What KeePass's own placeholder engine makes of field references and placeholders, held against pykeepassgate.refs. The host test ReferenceVectorsTests compiles every value with SprEngine, in the context of its entry, on a throwaway database holding these entries and with KPG_INVENTED_VARIABLE set, and holds keepass to what it makes; it rewrites keepass, and the order of each entry's strings, when KPG_WRITE_REFERENCE_VECTORS is set. resolver says what the client does with each: follows gives what KeePass gives, refuses raises, keeps gives the value as it is.",
